This condition distributes over every Boolean connective:
{{begin-eqn}}
{{eqn | l = x \in \map {f^{-1} } {A \cap B}
| o = \iff
| r = \map f x \in A \land \map f x \in B
}}
{{eqn | o = \iff
| r = x \in \map {f^{-1} } A \cap \map {f^{-1} } B
}}
{{end-eqn}}
and similarly for $\cup$ and complement.
